From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: taiga-expanded <taiga-expanded@local>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:01:48 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] ext: features on any planar face (side faces)

Goal features may carry a support normal (nx, ny, nz) and a global centre
(x, y, z): the sketch goes on the largest planar face with that normal instead
of the top face. New pieces live in freecad_s1/ext/ (faces, sampler); upstream
files get small hooks:
- expert: sketch support from ext.faces.support_for
- session: profile centre/sizes on side faces via ext.faces.local_box
- featurize: extra goal-parameter block (z, normal) after upstream's, all zeros
  for original goals, so they featurize exactly as before
- goals: new split "side"; the train split mixes in expanded goals
  (TAIGA_EXT_FRACTION, default 0.35); original splits are unchanged
- evaluate: new suite "side" (level 3, seed offset 40000)
Tests: tests/test_ext_faces.py (pure Python), tests/test_ext_runtime.py and
scripts/smoke_ext.py (FreeCAD).
